  "html": "<p>The creatures, from what ever evil place spawned appear to be very alien and sometimes reptilian in appearance.  They appear heavily scaled and thick-skinned, and sport all sorts of spikes, horns and bone-like plates.  They also appear to never use any weapons, save for their own claws, teeth and any other bony extensions.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Demons\"</h2>\n<p>There are 13 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Spawn\" title=\"Balzack's Spawn\">Balzack's Spawn</a></li></ul>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Thornlash\" title=\"Embercore Thornlash\">Embercore Thornlash</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frigidly_Cruel_Mauler\" title=\"Frigidly Cruel Mauler\">Frigidly Cruel Mauler</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frostbitten_Conscript\" title=\"Frostbitten Conscript\">Frostbitten Conscript</a></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>G</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/GG_Raver\" title=\"GG Raver\">GG Raver</a></span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/GoS_Second_In_Command\" title=\"GoS Second In Command\">GoS Second In Command</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/GoS_dark_reaver\" title=\"GoS dark reaver\">GoS dark reaver</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>K</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/KrypKogulous\" title=\"KrypKogulous\">KrypKogulous</a></li></ul>\n<h3>L</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Balrog\" title=\"Lava Balrog\">Lava Balrog</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mangler\" title=\"Mangler\">Mangler</a></li></ul>\n<h3>N</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Conscript\" title=\"Noxious Conscript\">Noxious Conscript</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_H